  <section id="about" style="padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff;">
	<h2>About Me</h2>
	<p style="font-size: 1.2em;">I’m Owen Moloney, an aspiring software engineer with a strong foundation in biochemistry and mathematics. Currently, I am pursuing a B.S. in Computer Science at Fordham University. I have developed a deep passion for software development, mobile app development, and data science. I'm always eager to learn new technologies and solve real-world problems with them.</p>
	
	<h3>Brief Background</h3>
	<p style="font-size: 1.2em;">With a background in biochemistry and mathematics, I transitioned to software engineering where I have spent over 240 hours honing my skills in C++, Java, Swift, and various database technologies such as MongoDB and Firebase. My journey also includes completing internships and courses that helped me build projects involving real-world applications such as mobile apps and data analytics.</p>
	
	<h3>What I’m Passionate About</h3>
	<p style="font-size: 1.2em;">I'm passionate about creating technology that improves lives, whether through building mobile apps, working with databases, or diving into the world of machine learning and AI. I thrive in environments that encourage collaboration and problem-solving, where I can continue to grow as a software engineer.</p>
	
	<a href="path/to/Owen_Moloney_Resume.pdf" download="Owen_Moloney_Resume.pdf" style="padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #28a745; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px;">Download My Resume</a>
  </section>


